ounced that the Biohub is offering free testing for all California...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111811069019801","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1154","post_id":"1154","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111811390256041","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-04-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1154/","text":"This is a great piece about how Joe DeRisi, co-president of the Biohub, helped discover SARS and how our team transformed the Biohub almost overnight into one of California's major testing facilities.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111811390256041","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1153","post_id":"1153","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111807251999141","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-04-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1153/","text":"As we start to think about what it will look like to re-open society, I wanted to provide an update on how we're planning for our teams at Facebook. The summary is: we're slowing our plans to return...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111807251999141","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1152","post_id":"1152","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111806366438811","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-04-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1152/","text":"I want to share an update on the work we're doing to connect people with accurate information and limit the spread of misinformation about Covid-19. On Facebook and Instagram, we've now directed more...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111806366438811","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1148","post_id":"1148","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10111803329474911","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-04-15","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1148/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1150","post_id":"1150","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111798568471001","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-04-14","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1150/","text":"Around 2pm PT, I'm going live with Dr. Tom Frieden, the former director of the CDC and founder of Resolve to Save Lives, a public health program funded by the Chan Zuckerberg Initiative. We'll talk...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10111798568471001","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1149","post_id":"1149","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10111799692977481/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-04-1